<div id="detailsContainer" class="details-container">
<div class="sp-p details-text">
<p>Manteca is a sans serif and blackletter combination font, which has a matching design between sans and blackletter that makes the font look unique. for black letters you can activate the stylistic set feature ( .ss01 ).</p>
<p>This font equipped with several features such as alternative characters, ligatures, and multi-language support that makes it easier for you to design. This font is perfect for your design needs such as poster design, logo design, branding, social media design, book, magazine, etc.</p>
<p><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Total Glyph: 413</li>
<li>Uppercase</li>
<li>Lowercase</li>
<li>Punctuation and Marks</li>
<li>Symbols</li>
<li>stylistic set &amp; Ligatures</li>
</ul>
